WEBVTT

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.440
It's freezing!

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:31.830
Snow?

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.790
Looks like it really came down.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.800
No wonder it's so cold.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.950
Until my room warms up,

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.750
I'm on standby.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.200
Good morning, Sagiri. Breakfast is ready.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.790
What took you so long?

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.000
Good morning.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.020
Did you catch a cold?

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.250
Yeah.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:19.540
The other day, Elf said she was stuck in bed because
she wasn't feeling well, so I went to visit her.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.440
It looks like I caught whatever she had.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:40.670
Are you okay?

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.020
I saw a doctor yesterday and got some medicine.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.160
Nii-san!

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.610
Nii-san, you feel really warm.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:53.790
Now that you mention it, I <i>have</i> been shivering.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.250
I thought it was just because of the cold.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.290
It's not just a mild fever. You're burning up.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.020
Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.630
No, you're not!

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:09.890
I don't want you to catch this.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.050
No! You're staying here.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.900
S-So I can nurse you back to health.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:23.310
If you leave my room, I can't look after you.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.610
Um, what should I do?

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:27.810
Sleep here!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.870
What? Here?

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.460
No complaining! Patients need to rest!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.480
<i>Sagiri's pillow...</i>

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.960
<i>And her blanket...</i>

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.210
<i>They smell like her.</i>

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:41.120
Nii-san.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.210
Y-Yes?!

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:46.530
Your fever's getting worse,
so you need to take your medicine.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:47.680
Where'd you put it?

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.600
The shelf in the living room.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.470
I'll go get it.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.520
Really?

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.250
Are you going to be okay?

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.420
Leaving my room carries great risk...

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.770
But this is an emergency!

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.280
I'm the only one who can save you now!

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.740
Sagiri...

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.640
I promise I'll make it back, so just wait for me.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.910
Be careful out there.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.450
I will!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:39.100
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.860
<i>Here I go!</i>

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.190
<i>Fight!</i>

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.230
That was easy.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:58.460
One of the big pills, and one of the small pills.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:02.030
If the fever is above 38 degrees, then...

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.670
Okay, got it!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.550
I have returned!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.470
38.5 degrees.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.400
That's worse than I thought.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.310
I guess I can't go to school after all.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.320
What?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.580
You were planning on going to school today?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.230
We've got midterms coming up.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.360
I need to know what'll be on them.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.960
Oh well, I can just ask Tomoe later.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.920
Tomoe-chan?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.290
Is she the one that came to deliver that lewd doujin?

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.620
Can't you remember her some other way?

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.460
Actually, the exams aren't even my biggest concern.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:44.960
What is it?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.850
I'm supposed to submit my newest script today.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.670
I have to get that in on time.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.430
Don't worry about that!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.080
You're going to stay in this room all day!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.350
O-Okay.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:01.140
There!

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:12.340
Nii-san.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.340
He fell asleep.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.340
Excuse me.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.580
There we go.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.090
I'll just move this...

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.340
Gotta... get this...

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.840
Get in there...

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.860
Nursing someone is a lot of work.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.870
I'll check his fever again.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:46.930
He's hot!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.860
That should do it.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.750
What am I going to do about <i>his</i> food?

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:12.860
Jeez!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:16.410
Why doesn't he keep any instant meals in the house?

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.460
He's not prepared for emergency situations at all.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.100
I'll have it delivered!

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:31.190
I know. I'll ask Elf-chan!

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.100
No good.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:36.530
I've got no options left.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.600
I'm finished.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.370
But there's still something I can do!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:52.670
Yeah!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.380
If I make too much noise, I'll wake him up.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.850
Fight. Fight.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.810
Oh, wait. This is loud too.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:17.950
Even I can handle a few
chores if I put my mind to it.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.370
Fight...

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.100
It's finally over.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:33.460
I can't believe he does all that stuff every day while he has work and school.

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:35.760
Oh yeah...

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.840
Muramasa-sensei?

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:44.810
You came here for dating advice, but don't you
think it's overkill planning out a <i>wedding</i>?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.810
N-Not at all!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.620
Everyone knows the next step after dating...

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:53.020
is m-m-m-marriage.

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.280
Excuse me.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.030
Oh, that's unusual.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.160
Eromanga-sensei's calling.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.280
Hello. How are you?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.490
<i>U-Um...</i>

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.650
What can I help you with?

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:08.050
<i>Nii-san...</i>

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.830
<i>Izumi Masamune-sensei caught a cold, and...</i>

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.160
<i>He has a fever.</i>

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.250
He caught a cold?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.020
Masamune-kun has a cold?!

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.080
Is that true, Eromanga-sensei?

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:19.710
<i>Muramasa-chan?!</i>

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:22.820
So? What's his current condition?

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.120
Did you see a doctor yet?

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.330
Have you called an ambulance?

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:26.350
Did you get him medicine?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.930
So then, what did you need?

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:32.020
I wanted to ask you about the work materials he was supposed to turn in today.

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.980
Oh, don't worry about that.
Have him send it when he's feeling better.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:39.490
<i>Tell him I hope he gets well soon,
Eromanga-sensei.</i>

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:43.400
I-I don't know anyone by that name.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.390
<i>You know I'm your editor, right?</i>

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.120
Kagurazaka-san.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.710
How may I be of service?

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.610
You don't need to worry about turning in the script.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:58.170
So try to get some res—

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.460
He's sweating a lot.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.110
What should I do?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.440
It's so hot...

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:16.180
Nii-san, your shirt's soaked.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:21.250
Well, since you're already awake,
let's get you changed.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.320
It's a little awkward changing here.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:43.220
Th-This is no time to be worrying about that.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.760
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.340
I want to wipe myself off.

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:53.050
Can you grab me a towel?

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:55.330
I-I'll wipe you down myself.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.730
You can't wipe your own back, right?

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.220
I think I'm about to spike a new fever.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:07.250
I-I'm just nursing you.

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:13.980
D-Don't imagine anything weird.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.420
Okay. Done!

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.050
Are you already asleep, Nii-san?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:38.980
<i>I think this is the first time
I've watched him sleep like this.</i>

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.110
Izumi-chan!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.360
Let's hang out!

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:50.540
Tomo-chan, do you have plans with Nii-san?

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:54.220
Mune-kun wasn't at school even though we have exams coming up.

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.290
I came to check up on him.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.340
"M-Mune-kun"?

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.880
She's awful chummy.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.510
Izumi-chan!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.860
Hello?! Izumi-chan?!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.180
No one's home.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:08.720
You're there, aren't you?

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.110
I'm not.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.860
I can see you, you know.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:22.980
Why are you here?

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.710
Open the door.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:25.470
No.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.530
Why not?

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.230
I came to return the light novel you lent me.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:31.300
I wanted to talk about the story with you.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.560
I can't today.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.620
Is something wrong?

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.450
I'm nursing a really sick patient.

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:38.520
Huh? Are you talking about your brother?

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:39.430
Yeah.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.750
Is there anything I can help with?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.690
It's fine.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.290
Mune-kun's sick?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.080
Sorry if I scared you.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.970
You're Mune-kun's sister, right?

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.690
It's nice to meet you. I'm Takasago Tomoe.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.250
You're the lewd doujin lady.

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:03.370
So you were saying that Mune-kun's sick?

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:05.610
H-He has a fever, but it's just a regular cold.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.070
He took some medicine, and he's asleep now.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.670
I suppose we should get out of your hair, then.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:16.870
Would you mind giving him these?

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.750
It's notes on what's going to be on the test,

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:23.710
and this novel he reserved that he was
supposed to pick up from our shop today.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.490
It's volume five of Eighty-Six.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.140
I want to read it too!

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.370
Tell Mune-kun I hope he gets well soon, okay?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.290
See you later.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.990
Let's go, Megumi.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.200
Okay.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.360
Tomoe-chan is a good person!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.680
New volume acquired!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:49.240
Again?

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.740
Didn't they leave already?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.070
Is there something else you needed?

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:59.530
That voice... Is that you, Eromanga-sensei?

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.210
M-Muramasa-chan.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.960
I heard that Masamune-kun has fallen ill with a cold.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.590
I'm here to check up on him.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:10.550
I said I was sure everything was fine,
but Kagurazaka-san insisted.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.680
Well, anyways, let me inside.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.680
No.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:16.060
Why not?

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.430
I-I just can't open this door for you.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.060
I heard that Elf waltzes right into your house all the time!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.470
She does that on her own.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.440
I've never once let her in.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:32.810
Then I'll do the same!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.110
I made sure to lock all the doors today.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:55.640
Muramasa-chan, you need to stop before
someone sees you and gets the wrong idea!

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:59.830
Why is Elf allowed inside but I'm not?!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.100
I told you already. Elf isn't allowed in!

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:11.030
Then what am I supposed to do with the stuff I brought for him?

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:12.950
Whatever fits through here.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.910
Let me in!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.000
I'm worried about Masamune-kun!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.720
He's fine.

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:23.070
What'll it take to open this door?

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:26.120
I'm glad that you came to see him.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.420
But I'm sorry. I can't open it.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:33.610
Fine, I get it.

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.640
I'll just have to deal with not coming in.

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:39.470
At least give him the stuff I brought him.

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.180
A vitamin drink?

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.850
A-And this.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.240
Huh? What's this?

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:50.720
This is...

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:51.820
Don't do it!

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:55.210
Do <i>not</i> look inside.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:58.160
Promise me you'll hand it to him as is.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.680
I understand.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.530
Okay...

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:11.760
For the record, getting that for him wasn't my idea.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.290
Kagurazaka-san said it'd be the best thing to make him feel better.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:17.390
Beginning contents inspection!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.270
You promised you wouldn't look!

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.140
All I said was that I understood.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.470
S-Stop it!

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.430
Th-This is...

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.430
Don't look!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.190
I'm begging you!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.120
Wh-What is this?!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.150
It's unseemly!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:35.740
I could never give such an
inappropriate picture to him!

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.950
I-I'll have to confiscate it.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.780
I'm going to use this as a drawing reference.

