00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.710
So in summary...

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:57.210
He got a cold from Elf-chan,

00:17:57.210 --> 00:18:00.870
Tomoe-chan brought him a book and notes,

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:03.640
and Muramasa-chan came to visit him.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:13.010
He's like a light novel protagonist.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.580
Mom...

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.700
It feels like your fever broke.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.290
Your hand feels nice.

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:42.140
Stay right there.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:43.680
Sure.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.610
Mom...

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.090
Nii-san?

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:06.140
Are you having the same kind of dream I was?

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.470
You know, Nii-san...

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:14.040
The two of us are the only family we have left.

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:22.450
If you weren't around,
I wonder what would've happened to me.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:28.800
Nii-san, thank you for everything.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.270
Hurry up and get better.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:58.000
I'll take over for now.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:35.790
Huh?

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.130
Did you make this?

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:40.090
Y-Yeah.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.040
That must have tough.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:47.050
Well, I couldn't make it as good as yours.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.320
It's good.

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:56.010
You did great, Sagiri!

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.230
Thank goodness.

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:05.170
Looks like my fever's down.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.960
It's all thanks to you.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.660
Th-That was just your medicine working.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:16.820
You know, I think I had a dream about when I was younger.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:20.880
I can't really remember it, but it was a nice dream.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:29.610
A cold?

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.770
Nii-san, I'm thirsty.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.730
I want juice.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.190
Coming right up.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.730
I want grated apples.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.760
Okay, I'll be right back.

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:44.760
Wait.

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:45.570
Yeah?

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:47.810
...you.

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:51.500
I said thank you.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:58.170
Oh, by the way, I got the okay on that script I submitted.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:01.340
Hurry up and get better so you can start on the sketches.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:03.250
Yeah. Leave it to me.

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:05.460
I'm counting on you, Eromanga-sensei.

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:09.970
I don't know anyone by that name!
